    "detailed_description": "<strong>The princess has been captured! Step into the armored boots of a frog and use your tongue as a grappling hook to beat challenging levels. Encounter quirky characters and dive into this thrilling rescue mission.</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2612320/extras/38f7af1dc00527b25678608e9854853a.poster.avif?t=1717359636\" width=600 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2612320/extras/38f7af1dc00527b25678608e9854853a.webm?t=1717359636\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2612320/extras/38f7af1dc00527b25678608e9854853a.mp4?t=1717359636\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>A simple but humorous story with lots of funny and strange characters.<br></li><li>Simple controls, but difficult to master.<br></li><li>4 different worlds with 300+ stages/screens and of course... some hidden secrets.<br></li><li>You're a FROG</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2612320/extras/500e4c7304f6c43718916fd7280a6125.poster.avif?t=1717359636\" width=600 height=214 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2612320/extras/500e4c7304f6c43718916fd7280a6125.webm?t=1717359636\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2612320/extras/500e4c7304f6c43718916fd7280a6125.mp4?t=1717359636\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
